# Wordle Game

## Description
Wordle is a word-guessing game where players try to guess a five-letter word in six attempts or less. The game provides feedback on each guess, indicating which letters are correct and in the correct position.

## Installation
1. Clone the repository: `git clone https://github.com/your-username/wordle-game.git`
2. Navigate to the project directory: `cd wordle-game`
3. Install dependencies: `npm install`

## Usage
1. Run the game: `npm start`
2. Enter a five-letter word and press Enter.
3. The game will provide feedback on your guess, indicating which letters are correct and in the correct position.
4. Keep guessing until you guess the correct word or run out of attempts.

## Features
- Guess a five-letter word
- Receive feedback on each guess
- Limited number of attempts
- Play again option

## Technologies Used
- JavaScript
- HTML
- CSS

